  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Best Farmers Mission 2023</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Best Farmers is an annually organized country-wide competition which was first initiated in January 2014. The competition was instituted to acknowledge farmers in Uganda who have demonstrated an outstanding performance in their farming business. During the competition, participants will showcase their farming successes. Aiming to inspire the youth to see the potential of treating farming as a business. The Best Farmers Competition highlights opportunities and potential of Ugandan agriculture enterprises to move away from subsistence farming to farming as a business. The Best Farmers both win a cash price ,to invest in their business and a trip to the Netherlands in which they go on company visits to exchange knowledge and create sustainable business connections.The program has grown to become one of the core flagships of the Netherlands in Uganda and created a sustainable networks between the Dutch and Ugandan private sector.</narrative>
  </description>
